{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the item count shown to shoppers (header bubble, drawer and cart titles). A made-to-measure line from the
  configurator has quantity = billed units (m²) and the private property _eenheid; it counts as 1 item, not 20.
  Use: {%- capture kk_count -%}{% render 'cart-count' %}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign kk_count = kk_count | plus: 0 -%}
  JS twin: KK.cartCount (assets/global.js).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign n = 0
  for item in cart.items
    if item.properties._eenheid != blank
      assign n = n | plus: 1
    else
      assign n = n | plus: item.quantity
    endif
  endfor
  echo n
-%}
